## Interface: 120007, 120100, 120105
## Title: |cff00e5ffSeviaths|rUsefulTools
## Notes: Everything Seviath in one addon for retail (Midnight): glowing farm spots, rares and gathering zones on the map, auction prices, crafting and farming profit on tooltips, auction/mail/vendor gold messages, the Codex encyclopedia (with Delves), Dungeons & Raids group tools and the Guild Helper.
## Author: Seviath
## Version: 2.0.0-retail
## X-Formerly: SeviathsFarmPack, SeviathsCodex, SeviathsDungeonsRaids, SeviathsGuildHelper
